 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Light Techniques</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to weaponize the radiation of your light constructs. When a creature fails a save against one of your innate technique features, you can spend 1 cursed energy to cause that creature to gain the poisoned condition and take radiant damage at the beginning of their turn equal to your CE modifier. This lasts a number of rounds equal to your CE modifier. A creature can make a Constitution saving throw at the end of their turn, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
